37: const TIME_SPECS: &str = "\
38: TIME SPECS (for --at, ranges and positional times):
39:   120, 120f        frame 120               3.2s, 500ms, 1:05.5   a timestamp
40:   50%              half of the video       start, end            first / last frame
41:   Intro            first frame of a scene (case-insensitive)   #3   scene index 3
42:   Intro[1]         second scene of type Intro
43:   Intro@1.2s       1.2s into the scene (also @12, @50%, @end)
44: RANGES: a..b (end exclusive), a.., ..b, all, or a scene name for the whole scene.
45: Run `timeline` to list scenes. Add --json to any command for machine-readable output.";
